{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lichgate: Tower Survivor</strong> is easy to learn- collect an arsenal of weapons and upgrades to defend from the continual onslaught of monsters. Surviving all nine gates of hell, however, will require strategy, cleverness, and...\u00a0<i>FLAMETHROWERS?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/42c73d5c12a9a186d500f31c60553b64.poster.avif?t=1772001692\" width=896 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/42c73d5c12a9a186d500f31c60553b64.webm?t=1772001692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/42c73d5c12a9a186d500f31c60553b64.mp4?t=1772001692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/0a1459157c77238f5020231f65e13698.avif?t=1772001692\" width=256 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your own tower of destruction.</strong> Mix and match from over 100 weapons and upgrades to make a different build every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/4638e3c67988436ef89c4fdbc2363a60.poster.avif?t=1772001692\" width=580 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/4638e3c67988436ef89c4fdbc2363a60.webm?t=1772001692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your shop to gain access to legendary weapons to obliterate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/18c9822fde576998fe5ec5688a69c062.poster.avif?t=1772001692\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/18c9822fde576998fe5ec5688a69c062.webm?t=1772001692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/4feca8abd631d127600ac4a90997d552.avif?t=1772001692\" width=256 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weigh the consequences of devilish pacts that will unlock your true potential, but will also affect how enemies get stronger.</strong>\u00a0Each type of enemy is strong or weak against different types of damage, so choose pacts that fit your build accordingly. Perhaps it's worth it to be greedy and take the perfect relic despite the consequences. You'll have to determine if economy, powerful relics, or higher quality items are what you need to succeed.\u00a0Choose from the options available, or up the ante and bargain for a better deal at the risk of what it may cost you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/a2ee6f3bb450fbd236c3988089f386fe.poster.avif?t=1772001692\" width=896 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/a2ee6f3bb450fbd236c3988089f386fe.webm?t=1772001692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/a2ee6f3bb450fbd236c3988089f386fe.mp4?t=1772001692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/extras/c2b6204ec7d672fbb42abbaf8d48b95c.avif?t=1772001692\" width=256 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 50 rounds with different builds to gain access to new relics to shape future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat each gate to unlock new difficulties that introduce new twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on leaderboards with your friends to see who can survive the longest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect achievements by surviving with unique constraints that challenge your strategies.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458500?t=1772001692","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/5f73890f2af874348b15c783adfbda7281d5e9c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772001692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/31e70de12eb232868addc8f4a24616f78db95078/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772001692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458500/31e70de12eb232868addc8f4a24616f78db95078/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772001692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Opti